{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-05_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-05",
  "title": "解决谁？",
  "storyCode": "6-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "55d0997e0b2676bef5a61d4739ce262334772caa291b52c35a7fdc871f678959",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......毫无人性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "阿米娅......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "嗯，我没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "依然能联系上煌、博士，以及灰喉吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "没问题的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "好。保持通讯，为她们指引方位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群",
      "text": "（饥渴的大吼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......现在的你们，我已经感受不到感情了。原来那若有若无的一丝丝恨意，都来自梅菲斯特......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "梅菲斯特怨恨的毒......我一定会清理干净。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我答应你们，我一定会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我们已经清理了沿途的整合运动，抵达预定地点。但我们发现贫民区内的状况有些异样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "驻守这个区域入口的近卫局小队并没有发现整合运动的踪迹，我想，我需要调查一下周围的情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "变异感染者的数量正在被削减？是你们的战果吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......小心。未查明的事情背后往往潜伏着危险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不要放松警惕，这些感染者远比之前的整合运动敌人难缠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "等我处理完这里的事情，就会派小队来支援你们。保持通讯畅通，完毕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "什么人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "报告！是我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不是说你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "啊......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......没事。进行报告吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "报告陈sir，按照你的指示，我们搜索了这片区域！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "有什么收获？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "没有！连一个整合运动都没有发现！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我说的是搜索所有的异常情况！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "呃......抱歉，我们实在是不熟这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "毕竟依照惯例，除非是严重到需要我们直接摧毁某个区域的事件，否则，这里的事情我们是不参与的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......我知道，只要闹得不大，你们就当贫民区不存在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "在我们堵截整合运动时，这里传来了巨大的噪音，半个街区里的居民全部失踪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你看看我们脚下散落的这一地玩具......你自己看看，怎么可能没有异常状况？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我可不记得计划里有这么一条，内容是“撤走贫民区内所有居民”的这一条。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "......是有一些奇怪的迹象。区域里，大多数可居住的独立建筑都变成了废墟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "仅存的几条街也彻底空置，很有可能是整合运动和当地居民交火的结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "也有一些起火现象，火焰已经被我们扑灭了，失火原因似乎是持续烹饪加热。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "所有建筑物都有被暴力入侵的迹象，我们却几乎没发现住户反抗的痕迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "至于整合运动，我们真的是一个整合运动也没发现。只是......有冲刷和清洗的痕迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你不关心这里的市民吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "......抱歉陈sir！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你在抱歉什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "不知道，sir！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......行了。是啊，凭什么要你们关心这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "现在，立刻派队封锁整个区域！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不要让任何一个人、一辆交通工具漏过去，不管是整合运动还是什么东西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "接下来，你，你，跟着我。我们去北边看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（等等，别出声！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "（跟我这边走，动作快。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "很敏锐的感知力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你在做什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "准备射击！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "你不该追来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "约束你的部下，陈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你们，去找诗怀雅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "text": "可是陈sir......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "是谁派你们来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我没有向你解释的义务。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你是不是想逃跑？如果你逃跑，我就立刻缉捕你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "没有人会相信一群不知来源没有身份的暴力武装分子，近卫局会严肃对待你们，甚至将你们直接击毙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "重新训练一支近卫局队伍会耗费龙门大量的时间、资产与人才。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "损失整个近卫局，相当于折毁龙门民众的心理支柱。这不是你该冒的风险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "哈，我是该先对你的威胁感到“害怕”，还是该先谢谢你认真考虑了龙门的未来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "陈，近卫局是龙门的颜面，也是龙门的支柱，龙门最出色的常规力量之一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "除此之外的职务，近卫局不要染指。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "也不该染指。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "威胁我没有用。回答问题，这片区域的居民去了哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我的手指就按在全员通报键上，你们想和近卫局全面为敌只要短短一秒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "或者，你可以在一秒钟之内，偏转我的剑刃，切掉我的手臂，拿下通讯器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "贫民区的居民究竟去了哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我们会退出这里。陈，我们一起退出。现在这段时间，我们互不干扰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你想去哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "整合运动指挥官操纵的新型感染者，很可能会阻碍全盘战略的实施。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我们会为近卫局快速消除他们的威胁，请迅速歼灭整合运动的主要部队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "如果近卫局想要实现原本的战略目标，就该把眼光放在自己的职责上。做好你们该做的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "等下！你想就这样离开？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "想来就来，想走就走？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "陈警司，提醒你一句。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不要对这里发生的事情追根究底。我只是看在魏公的面子上，不和你再多做计较。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "以及，切下你的手臂很容易。你意志坚定时比现在强上百倍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "喂——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "诗怀雅，别过来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "哪里走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "免送。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "可恶！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "......怎么回事？你刚刚是和谁，吵了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "龙门的特殊力量私下出动了。这片区域内的所有居民都生死不明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "啊？你说啥？怎么会有这种东西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "别蒙我，你心里有底。至少你听过，你绝对知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "......我哪知道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "不，你也知道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我不知道。但你的祖父一定知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "啊？你在说啥，我一点都不懂！丢啊，能不能说直白点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "我爷爷到现在还趟在病床上，他连话都说不清！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "难道疾病就能阻止他操作龙门？你祖父是什么人，你比我清楚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "绝对不可能！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "......但......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你想说谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "“灰色的林”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "哼，现在“不可能”这三个字，该轮到我来说了。林视整个贫民区如己出，怎么会允许这种事发生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "text": "打个电话问问，也许就知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
